@token = 请先调用 http/users.http 的登录接口，把返回的 data.token 粘贴到此处

### 申请图片直传地址（size 为实际文件字节数）
# @name presignImage
POST {{baseUrl}}/uploads/presign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "cover.png",
  "mime": "image/png",
  "size": 20480
}

### 用返回的 upload_url 直传图片到 OSS（示例文件放到 http/fixtures/ 下）
PUT {{presignImage.response.body.$.data.upload_url}}
Content-Type: image/png

< ./fixtures/cover.png

### 确认图片上传（服务端校验 OSS 对象后写入附件表）
POST {{baseUrl}}/uploads/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "upload_token": "{{presignImage.response.body.$.data.upload_token}}"
}

### 申请视频直传地址
# @name presignVideo
POST {{baseUrl}}/uploads/presign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "chapter.mp4",
  "mime": "video/mp4",
  "size": 10485760
}

### 直传视频到 OSS
PUT {{presignVideo.response.body.$.data.upload_url}}
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./fixtures/chapter.mp4

### 确认视频上传
POST {{baseUrl}}/uploads/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "upload_token": "{{presignVideo.response.body.$.data.upload_token}}"
}
